  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4ed5f55d63a8a14cb8fc3f6624472bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: firstMatch
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  key: firstMatch
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - Now, for the bread and butter of your job - sorting through the archives!
  - As a curator, its important that you stay knowledgeable about the entire collection;
    therefore, I've recruited some of my spren colleagues to help make this process
    a little more engaging!
  - Once you release them into the museum, the spren will all select a work from
    the archive that is ready for review - you're job is to catch them all!
  - To catch a spren, click on it or the card it is holding - then, use the Matching
    Scanner to select the matching definition for each card. You can use keys 1-4
    on the keyboard to select your answer.
  - If you select the right definition, the card's mastery level will increase, it
    will be added back to the archives, and the spren will happily dissipate.
  - If you select an incorrect definition, the card's mastery level will drop and
    the spren will continue wandering the museum.
  - If you have a particularly tricky card, you can always drop the spren using the
    right mouse button and catch it again later.
  - To complete this task, be sure to review all assigned archives! Don't worry about
    making mistakes - while that may set your mastery back, it is all part of the
    learning process!
  - Now get after it - the matching destination is highlighted in yellow!
  outlineTag: Matching
